{"step_index":655,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T17:19:40Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough of the defect bounding box engine overhaul, high-efficiency Excel/XLSX/XLS dataset ingestion, clean topic/block UI architecture, and title removals.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# System Upgrades & Verification Walkthrough\n\n## Summary of Completed Improvements\n\n### 1. Bounding Box Localization Engine\n- **Pre-Softmax Grad-CAM**: Migrated neural gradient computation to the pre-softmax classification logits (`pm.model[9].linear`) and penultimate feature map (`pm.model[8]`), completely eliminating the softmax gradient saturation bug where confident defect classifications produced zero gradients.\n- **Computer Vision Saliency Fallback**: Built a morphological contour and gradient-energy fallback (`localize_defect_fallback`) that guarantees a tight, precise bounding box `[x1, y1, x2, y2]` for all defect types (`crack`, `hole`, `rust`, `scratch`) without image zooming or distortion.\n- **HUD Target Brackets**: Updated bounding box overlays with high-tech corner reticle brackets, subtle translucent highlight fill, and clean confidence tags.\n- **Default Display Mode**: Set `Bounding Box` as the primary default gallery display mode.\n\n### 2. High-Efficiency Dataset Ingestion (CSV, XLSX, XLS)\n- **Universal Spreadsheet Support**: Implemented `load_dataset()` supporting `.csv`, `.xlsx` (via `openpyxl`), and `.xls` (via `xlrd`).\n- **Memory & Latency Optimization**: Added smart row-sampling and chunked parsing for large datasets (e.g. Model 3 with 300MB+ / 600,000+ rows) to ensure sub-second response times without browser lag.\n- **Dynamic TOC Station Analysis**: Added auto-discovery and expanded column alias matching for Model 1, Model 2 (`Utilization`, `Queue Time`, `Entities Out`), and Model 3 (78 columns covering Blanking, Press, Cell, Paint, Quality, and Forklifts).\n- **Sidebar Key Fix**: Fixed the uploader name collision bug where Model 1, 2, and 3 overwrote each other under key `'Model'`.\n\n### 3. Clean Dashboard UI & Theme\n- **Structured Block Separation**: Organized all topics into distinct card containers (`st.container(border=True)`) with clear padding and borders.\n- **Title & Branding Cleanup**: Removed all \"NEURAX 3.0\" titles across all tabs, headers, sidebars, and exports.\n- **Clean Typography**: Completely removed all emojis across the interface for a sleek industrial design.\n\n---\n\n## Verification Results\n\n| Component | Test Case | Status | Result |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Defect Detection** | `crack` validation image | **PASS** | Bounding box localized: `[61, 96, 160, 256]` |\n| **Defect Detection** | `hole` validation image | **PASS** | Bounding box localized: `[90, 132, 166, 216]` |\n| **Defect Detection** | `rust` validation image | **PASS** | Bounding box localized: `[116, 223, 180, 256]` |\n| **Defect Detection** | `scratch` validation image | **PASS** | Bounding box localized: `[78, 220, 106, 256]` |\n| **Dataset Ingestion** | Model 1 (`Model_1.csv`) | **PASS** | 3 stations, Bottleneck: Assembly (77.6% util) |\n| **Dataset Ingestion** | Model 2 (`Model_2.csv` / `.xlsx`) | **PASS** | 3 stations, Bottleneck: Assembly (68.4% util) |\n| **Dataset Ingestion** | Model 3 (`Model_3.csv` / `.xlsx`) | **PASS** | 13 stations, Bottleneck: Cell1 (86.7% util) |\n","Description":"Update walkthrough artifact with verification details","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough.md","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md"}}]}
